  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "If we want to add custom user properties like “Age, Country & Salary” to the **ASP.NET Core Identity Users** then we can do this by adding **Custom User Properties** to the User class. The User class, as we all know, inherits from the IdentityUser parent class. These new custom properties are added as new columns to the AspNetUsers table of Identity database."
      }
    },
